<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">master-lockpicks</ansi> (jewelcrafting recipe)

A masterwork set of lockpicks crafted with jeweler's precision.
Polished edges and balanced tension allow the master craftsman to
feel every subtle resistance in even the most complex locks.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       jewelcrafting (minimum 25)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     jeweler's workbench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> silver bar (x1), masterwork gem (x2),
                  crafting steel (x2)

